  "notes": "A payslip with five tables: a key/value header grid (3 rows x 6 cells, three pairs per row, no header row), the earnings table (total row 'Gesamtbrutto' whose label spans 4 columns), TWO SMALL TABLES SIDE BY SIDE (taxes left, social insurance right; reading order left table first), and the net-to-payout table. The boxed line 'Auszahlungsbetrag ... EUR' repeats the last total and is not a table. The small underlined sender line above the address window and the letterhead are furniture; the recipient address, the month/date block and the bank line are body but not sentences. Numbers use German format (dot thousands, comma decimals). Section titles Bezüge, Gesetzliche Abzüge, Vom Nettobetrag zur Auszahlung and Hinweise are level-2 headings; the header cells 'Steuern' and 'Sozialversicherung' are table header cells, not headings. No lists."
